OL,3,CAntisemitism in UK spiked after Iran
OL,4,Cwar began, report suggests
OL,6,FAntisemitism in the UK spiked in the
OL,7,Fimmediate aftermath of the US and
OL,8,FIsrael launching their war on Iran and
OL,9,Ffollowing a double stabbing of two
OL,10,Fvisibly Jewish men in London,
OL,11,Faccording to a report.
OL,13,FData from the Community Security Trust
OL,14,F(CST), showed there were 1,926
OL,15,Fantisemitic incidents recorded across
OL,16,Fthe UK in January to June of 2026 ` up
OL,17,Fby a fifth on the first half of last
OL,18,Fyear from 1,598.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
