OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785997084
OL,3,CAntisemitism in UK spiked after Iran
OL,4,Cwar began, report suggests
OL,6,FIt is the second-highest total
OL,7,Freported to CST in the first six
OL,8,Fmonths of any year, exceeded only by
OL,9,Fthe 2,019 incidents recorded in the
OL,10,Ffirst half of 2024.
OL,12,FThe statistics have been branded
OL,13,F"appalling" by policing and crime
OL,14,Fminister Sarah Jones, who said each
OL,15,Fincident represents "people living in
OL,16,Ffear just for being who they are".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
