PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785997084
OL,3,CAntisemitism in UK spiked after Iran
OL,4,Cwar began, report suggests
OL,6,FThe first few months of 2026 saw a
OL,7,Fseries of arson attacks at Jewish
OL,8,Fsites in London, including on four
OL,9,FJewish community ambulances, as well
OL,10,Fas a double stabbing in Golders Green
OL,11,Fwhich was treated as an act of
OL,12,Fterrorism.
OL,14,FThe CST, which monitors antisemitism
OL,15,Fin the UK, said the April 29 stabbings
OL,16,Fwhich left two men injured, triggered
OL,17,Fthe highest daily antisemitic incident
OL,18,Ftotals of the six-month period.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
