PN,31004
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785997084
OL,3,CAntisemitism in UK spiked after Iran
OL,4,Cwar began, report suggests
OL,6,FA total of 71 incidents were recorded
OL,7,Fby CST in the three days following the
OL,8,Fstabbing, 16 of which the organisation
OL,9,Fsaid directly referenced the attack.
OL,11,FThe CST said some of the incidents
OL,12,F"celebrated the violence and called
OL,13,Ffor further injuries to Jewish people,
OL,14,For used the incident to promote
OL,15,Fantisemitic conspiracy theories and
OL,16,Fanti-Jewish abuse".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
