OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785997084
OL,3,CAntisemitism in UK spiked after Iran
OL,4,Cwar began, report suggests
OL,6,FMeanwhile, the organisation said the
OL,7,Fweek following February 28, which
OL,8,Fmarked the start of the war on Iran by
OL,9,FIsrael and the US, saw a 71% jump in
OL,10,Fantisemitic incidents in the UK
OL,11,Fcompared with the week before ` from
OL,12,F52 to 89.
OL,14,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,15,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,16,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,17,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/11
