OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785997084
OL,3,CAntisemitism in UK spiked after Iran
OL,4,Cwar began, report suggests
OL,6,FLast week, a man from Brighton pleaded
OL,7,Fguilty over a Facebook post suggesting
OL,8,Fthrowing eggs, fruit and stink bombs
OL,9,Fat synagogues and Jewish businesses.
OL,11,FThe timing of the post, made on the
OL,12,Fday the war began, prompted the
OL,13,Fprosecutor in the case to ask for him
OL,14,Fto be given a tougher sentence for a
OL,15,Frace hate crime. He is expected to be
OL,16,Fsentenced in September.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
