OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785997084
OL,3,CAntisemitism in UK spiked after Iran
OL,4,Cwar began, report suggests
OL,6,FThe Islamic Movement of Companions of
OL,7,Fthe Right (IMCR) ` a new terrorism
OL,8,Fgroup with suspected links to pro-
OL,9,FIranian networks, according to
OL,10,FIsrael's ministry for diaspora affairs
OL,11,Fand combating antisemitism ` has
OL,12,Fclaimed responsibility for a number of
OL,13,Frecent attacks, including the torching
OL,14,Fof the Jewish community ambulances in
OL,15,FGolders Green in March.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/11
