OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785997084
OL,3,CAntisemitism in UK spiked after Iran
OL,4,Cwar began, report suggests
OL,6,FIn July the government, under then-
OL,7,Fprime minister Sir Keir Starmer, said
OL,8,Fit was laying draft regulations before
OL,9,FParliament to designate as a threat to
OL,10,Fnational security the IMCR as well as
OL,11,FIran's Islamic Revolutionary Guard
OL,12,FCorps (IRGC).
OL,14,FThe move is designed to tackle Iranian-
OL,15,Fbacked groups recruiting criminals for
OL,16,Facts targeting the Jewish community.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
