OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785997084
OL,3,CAntisemitism in UK spiked after Iran
OL,4,Cwar began, report suggests
OL,6,FCST chief executive Mark Gardner said
OL,7,Fthe incidents detailed in its latest
OL,8,Freport "should concern everyone who
OL,9,Fcares about Britain and the threats
OL,10,Fagainst it, whether state-directed
OL,11,Ffrom Iran, or internally driven by
OL,12,FIslamist, far Right, far Left, or
OL,13,Fother ideological extremes".
OL,15,FThe government's independent advisor
OL,16,Fon antisemitism, Lord Mann, said the
OL,17,Flatest figures "demonstrate that anti-
OL,18,FJewish racism in the UK remains at all
OL,19,Fall-time high and continues to pose a
OL,20,Fsignificant threat to our democracy".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
