OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785997084
OL,3,CAntisemitism in UK spiked after Iran
OL,4,Cwar began, report suggests
OL,6,FHe added: "It is especially concerning
OL,7,Fto see the nature of antisemitism in
OL,8,Fthe UK becoming increasingly violent,
OL,9,Ffrom the stabbing of two British Jews
OL,10,Fin Golders Green, to a series of arson
OL,11,Fattacks against synagogues and Jewish-
OL,12,Flinked properties.
OL,14,F"I would like to thank CST and the
OL,15,Fpolice for their relentless efforts to
OL,16,Fprotect the British Jewish community,
OL,17,Fand I will continue to work alongside
OL,18,Fthem to ensure zero tolerance for anti-
OL,19,FJewish hatred in this country."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
