OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785997084
OL,3,CAntisemitism in UK spiked after Iran
OL,4,Cwar began, report suggests
OL,6,FSpeaking for the government, Jones
OL,7,Fsaid: "Behind these appalling numbers
OL,8,Fare people living in fear just for
OL,9,Fbeing who they are."
OL,11,FHe added: "We are investing a record
OL,12,F#250 million to boost policing in
OL,13,FJewish neighbourhoods. I am also proud
OL,14,Fto work hand in hand with the CST to
OL,15,Fprotect synagogues, Jewish schools and
OL,16,Fcommunity centres. We must never stop
OL,17,Ffighting to rid society of this evil."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/11
